{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9cc32c487761fe10","name":"Tartan-Class Patrol Cruiser","source":{"id":"source:reference-9cc32c487761fe10","title":"Tartan-Class Patrol Cruiser","revision":25030,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T20:33:50Z","sha256":"cee6a1dad1d035d85eb6b75152407dd3cc1f26afb2d6ea1d576ba13e9b01e31d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25030","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Tartan-Class%20Patrol%20Cruiser&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9cc32c487761fe10","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Zann Consortium"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Zann_Consortium","referenceId":"reference:939c32df8a6e4fbd"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One of the first ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," to be commissioned for the newly formed Empire, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Tartan"]},"-Class Patrol Cruiser is a fast and deadly ship used to supplement Imperial patrols throughout the galaxy. Produced by the Damorian Manufacturing Corporation, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Tartan"]},"-Class is primarily used against fighters, bombers, and small pirate vessels, and is usually tasked with keeping order. Though modestly armed, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Tartan"]},"-Class Patrol Cruiser complements other mid-sized ships, such as the ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Carrack"]},"-Class Light Cruiser"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Carrack-Class_Light_Cruiser","referenceId":"reference:fc38d60c42ac0e9b"},", while requiring a much smaller crew complement.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Tartan"]},"-Class Patrol Cruiser is a versatile ship that can transfer power between its systems with relative ease. As a result, one less ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," is required to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Recharge Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Recharge_Shields","referenceId":"reference:d4549c92a68a5d8a"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reroute Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reroute_Power","referenceId":"reference:ae948ebe3acd7ddc"}," aboard the ship (usually resulting in both actions requiring two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," to complete). The ship is also exceptionally faster than others its size, allowing it to pursue ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transports"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transports","referenceId":"reference:082a04e1f80578b3"}," that can usually escape ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},". Though it's no match for larger vessels, such as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nebulon-B Frigate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nebulon-B_Frigate"},", the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Tartan"]},"-Class Patrol Cruiser is an excellent support ship that can outgun many corvettes and still pose a major threat to attacking ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Tartan"]},"-Class Patrol Cruiser Statistics (CL 15)"]},"\n",{"t